%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Microsoft JhengHei, sans-serif","fontSize":"20px","primaryColor":"#edf5f1","primaryTextColor":"#17302d","primaryBorderColor":"#176e60","lineColor":"#536b64","edgeLabelBackground":"#ffffff"},"flowchart":{"htmlLabels":false,"curve":"basis","nodeSpacing":35,"rankSpacing":40}}}%%
flowchart TD
  accTitle: HR招募建議與Computer Use模擬刊登流程
  accDescr: HR輸入需求，系統依職稱套用本機範本或研究網路來源。HR核准後，由獨立Chrome中的Computer Use填表。後端核對一致，預設再由HR確認，才送出模擬刊登；資料儲存在隔離暫存資料庫，沒有正式平台刊登。
  A([HR輸入職位與需求]) --> B{有對應本機範本？}
  B -->|有| C[套用35類本機範本]
  B -->|無| D[網路研究並附來源]
  C --> E[保留HR指定條件\n補全項目標示建議]
  D --> E
  E --> F[HR首次確認需求]
  F --> G[Computer Use\n開啟獨立Chrome]
  G --> H[看圖決策與填表\n儲存草稿並預覽]
  H --> I{符合HR核准版本？}
  I -->|否：回饋差異| H
  I -->|是| J[HR再次確認網站內容\n可於首次核准時取消]
  J --> K[模擬刊登申請\n待審核]
  K --> L[模擬審核與處理中]
  L --> M([模擬成功／失敗])
  H -.->|草稿| N[(隔離暫存資料庫\n草稿與刊登狀態)]
  M -.->|更新狀態| N
  classDef hr fill:#e5f3ec,stroke:#176e60,color:#17302d,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef action fill:#f6f8fa,stroke:#74818e,color:#273440;
  classDef decision fill:#fff6e7,stroke:#a4651b,color:#694213;
  classDef done fill:#e8f3fa,stroke:#30698c,color:#173c55,stroke-width:2px;
  class A,F,J hr;
  class C,D,E,G,H,K,L,N action;
  class B,I decision;
  class M done;
